{"ref":"BDB, גִּתִּי²","hw":"גִּתִּי²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גִּתִּי</span></big>  <strong>adj.gent.</strong> of ii. <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּת</span> <strong>1</strong>; of Obed-edom <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:10\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.10\">2 S 6:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 6:11\" href=\"/II_Samuel.6.11\">11</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 13:13\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.13.13\">1 Ch 13:13</a>; Ittai <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:19\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.19\">2 S 15:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:22\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.22\">22</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 18:2\" href=\"/II_Samuel.18.2\">18:2</a>; Goliath <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:19\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.19\">21:19</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 20:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.20.5\">1 Ch 20:5</a>; pl. c. art. as subst., <span dir=\"rtl\">הַגִּתִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:18\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.18\">1 S 15:18</a> <em>the Gittites</em> (but read <span dir=\"rtl\">אִתַּי הַגִּתִּי</span> We Klo Kit Bu Now<sup>Arch.i.308 n.</sup>); sg. c. art. as n.pr.coll. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַגִּתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:3\" href=\"/Joshua.13.3\">Jos 13:3</a> (with men of Gaza, Ashdod, Ashḳelon, Eḳron, and the Awwim).","next":"BDB, גִּתִּית²","prev":"BDB, גַּת־רִמּוֹן"}